      "product_faq": [
        {
          "question": "Who are we?",
          "answer": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer located in Quanzhou, Fujian, China, one of the well-known footwear production areas in China."
        },
        {
          "question": "How can we guarantee quality?",
          "answer": "We pay attention to key details such as shoe shape, upper workmanship, stitching, bonding, sole flexibility, wearing comfort, appearance consistency and packaging condition. Before delivery, we will check the products according to order requirements to help reduce quality risks for customers."
        },
        {
          "question": "Are you a trading company or a manufacturer?",
          "answer": "We are a manufacturer."
        },
        {
          "question": "Why should you buy from us not from other suppliers?",
          "answer": "Our advantages are mainly reflected in product focus, flexible production and customer-oriented service. We specialize in casual and sport-casual footwear, especially slip-on sneakers and lightweight knit shoes. We can provide various styles, colors, materials and sole designs according to market needs. We support OEM and ODM cooperation."
        },
        {
          "question": "What services can we provide?",
          "answer": "We can provide flexible support from sample development to bulk production. We support OEM and ODM cooperation. Customization options may include upper material, color combination, outsole design, logo placement, label, insole, shoebox, packaging and other details."
        }
      ],
